/T (Deepfake: Realistic images or videos of a person generated or manipulated using artificial intelligence, often without the consent of the person depicted. In the context of this report, deepfakes refer specifically to sexually explicit content created without consent.)
/E (Deepfake: Realistic images or videos of a person generated or manipulated using artificial intelligence, often without the consent of the person depicted. In the context of this report, deepfakes refer specifically to sexually explicit content created without consent.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
540 0 obj
<<
