<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 367 0 R
/T (Platform policy can establish clear severity-based escalation standards and clearly articulate how different types of harm are prioritised. Platforms can strengthen moderator training in culturally specific and identity-based harms, including non-Western linguistic nuances. Platform policy should align reporting processes with emerging digital duty of care expectations \(government policies\), ensuring procedural fairness and meaningful communication with users.)
/E (Platform policy can establish clear severity-based escalation standards and clearly articulate how different types of harm are prioritised. Platforms can strengthen moderator training in culturally specific and identity-based harms, including non-Western linguistic nuances. Platform policy should align reporting processes with emerging digital duty of care expectations \(government policies\), ensuring procedural fairness and meaningful communication with users.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [13]
>>
