595 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 368 0 R
/T (Government policies and regulatory bodies should develop and enforce data retention, storage, and access standards for platform-generated evidence records, ensuring that verified records are readily available to users seeking to report harm or take legal action, without placing the burden of documentation on those affected. Government policies and regulatory bodies should enforce baseline industry standards for detecting and preventing the circulation of harmful or intimate content, verifying consent before intimate or sensitive content involving another person is shared, biometric analysis to support identification of non-consensual image distribution, and transparency obligations requiring platforms to disclose how content detection and moderation decisions are made.)
/E (Government policies and regulatory bodies should develop and enforce data retention, storage, and access standards for platform-generated evidence records, ensuring that verified records are readily available to users seeking to report harm or take legal action, without placing the burden of documentation on those affected. Government policies and regulatory bodies should enforce baseline industry standards for detecting and preventing the circulation of harmful or intimate content, verifying consent before intimate or sensitive content involving another person is shared, biometric analysis to support identification of non-consensual image distribution, and transparency obligations requiring platforms to disclose how content detection and moderation decisions are made.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
