/T (Establish platform guardrails for AI-based safety mechanisms, ensuring they redirect users to verified resources rather than independently interpreting or advising on high-risk situations. Platforms should define clear protocols for how sensitive information shared by users with AI-based safety assistants is logged, stored, and escalated, particularly where users disclose high-risk situations such as coercive control, threats, or self-harm.)
