/T (The second round of workshops was conducted with experts working in areas related to protecting women and gender-diverse individuals from technology-facilitated abuse. This included researchers, industry stakeholders, community advocates, and policymakers. In total, six expert workshops were conducted with 21 participants. These workshops built directly on insights from the user workshops and focused on critique, refinement, and evaluation of the design and policy ideas generated by users.)
