/T (Rather than requesting entirely new safety tools, participants focused on improving the reporting experience itself. They wanted clearer categories that matched their situations, simpler steps during moments of distress, visible progress updates, and reassurance that a real person or accountable system was taking their case seriously. Across workshops, the emphasis shifted from simply enabling reports to making the process feel responsive, transparent, and supportive. The following features reflect these needs.)
