/E (Participants therefore called for clearer feedback and progress tracking throughout the process. Suggestions included acknowledgement messages, estimated timelines, status dashboards, and notifications explaining what actions were taken. Rather than a one-off submission, reporting was envisioned as an ongoing, transparent process that shows where a case sits and what happens next.)
/Pg 43 0 R
/K [17]
