/P 397 0 R
/T (Providing direct access to human moderators or external authorities can improve user reassurance and support documentation for potential legal action. At the same time, experts noted risks including reports being escalated to law enforcement prematurely or without sufficient evidence, the potential for malicious misuse of escalation pathways, and users developing expectations that platforms can guarantee an immediate police response. Clear criteria and safeguards would therefore be necessary to prevent misuse and ensure escalation pathways function as intended.)
/E (Providing direct access to human moderators or external authorities can improve user reassurance and support documentation for potential legal action. At the same time, experts noted risks including reports being escalated to law enforcement prematurely or without sufficient evidence, the potential for malicious misuse of escalation pathways, and users developing expectations that platforms can guarantee an immediate police response. Clear criteria and safeguards would therefore be necessary to prevent misuse and ensure escalation pathways function as intended.)
/Pg 47 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
