/T (Measures such as screenshot notifications, download restrictions, or automatic detection of reused content could increase friction and awareness, helping users notice when their content is being copied or misused. However, they cautioned that these features are unlikely to fully prevent misuse, as determined actors can still capture content through alternative means \(for example, external devices or third-party tools\). As such, these mechanisms may reduce casual harm but not eliminate deliberate abuse.)
/E (Measures such as screenshot notifications, download restrictions, or automatic detection of reused content could increase friction and awareness, helping users notice when their content is being copied or misused. However, they cautioned that these features are unlikely to fully prevent misuse, as determined actors can still capture content through alternative means \(for example, external devices or third-party tools\). As such, these mechanisms may reduce casual harm but not eliminate deliberate abuse.)
/Pg 49 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
