<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 399 0 R
/T (Experts also reflected on the potential burden placed on users. Frequent warnings, confirmations, or notifications may become normalised and ignored over time, reducing their usefulness or adding cognitive load. Overly complex controls could disproportionately affect people with lower digital literacy or those already managing stressful situations.)
/E (Experts also reflected on the potential burden placed on users. Frequent warnings, confirmations, or notifications may become normalised and ignored over time, reducing their usefulness or adding cognitive load. Overly complex controls could disproportionately affect people with lower digital literacy or those already managing stressful situations.)
/Pg 49 0 R
/K [16]
>>
