/T (Few participants discussed situations where leaving or closing an account felt necessary for safety or wellbeing, such as after harassment, hacking, or ongoing abuse. However, doing so often meant losing years of photos, messages, connections, and personal history. This created a difficult trade-off: staying on a platform that felt unsafe, or leaving and losing important memories and content.)
/E (Few participants discussed situations where leaving or closing an account felt necessary for safety or wellbeing, such as after harassment, hacking, or ongoing abuse. However, doing so often meant losing years of photos, messages, connections, and personal history. This created a difficult trade-off: staying on a platform that felt unsafe, or leaving and losing important memories and content.)
