/T (Across workshops, participants consistently described not knowing what safety features exist, where to find them, or how they work. Many participants reflected that safety controls are frequently buried within settings, vaguely labelled, or introduced without explanation. Frequent interface updates meant users missed newly implemented protections. In moments of distress, trying to search through menus or interpret technical terms added to anxiety rather than reducing it.)
