/T (Experts broadly supported integrating safety education into onboarding and contextual prompts, but stressed careful pacing, clarity, and inclusivity. Well-designed nudges may strengthen user awareness and agency, whereas poorly timed or overly frequent prompts risk disengagement.)
/E (Experts broadly supported integrating safety education into onboarding and contextual prompts, but stressed careful pacing, clarity, and inclusivity. Well-designed nudges may strengthen user awareness and agency, whereas poorly timed or overly frequent prompts risk disengagement.)
/Pg 70 0 R
