/T (The difficulty of defining harm also influences how users engage with safety mechanisms. Participants described hesitation in reporting certain incidents because they were unsure whether the behaviour would be recognised as abuse, or because previous reports had been dismissed as not violating platform policies [24]. In this way, uncertainty about how harm is defined can discourage reporting and contribute to the normalisation of harmful behaviour within online environments [12].)
