/E (Transparency therefore emerged as an important factor in building trust in reporting systems. When users cannot see how decisions are made or why certain actions are taken, moderation processes can appear arbitrary or unresponsive. These concerns echo broader Safety by Design principles, which emphasise the importance of transparency and clear accountability in how platforms manage online harms [10].)
