/P 431 0 R
/T (Sophie \(She/her\), a 19-year-old woman begins receiving late-night messages on [Facebook/ Instagram/ TikTok] from someone she does not know. At first, the messages are short and unusual, but over time they become persistent and uncomfortable, pressuring her to respond. Sophie ignores them, hoping they will stop, but the messages continue each night. The repeated contact makes her feel uneasy and concerned about her safety, leaving her unsure how to manage the ongoing intrusion.)
/E (Sophie \(She/her\), a 19-year-old woman begins receiving late-night messages on [Facebook/ Instagram/ TikTok] from someone she does not know. At first, the messages are short and unusual, but over time they become persistent and uncomfortable, pressuring her to respond. Sophie ignores them, hoping they will stop, but the messages continue each night. The repeated contact makes her feel uneasy and concerned about her safety, leaving her unsure how to manage the ongoing intrusion.)
/Pg 81 0 R
/K [4]
