6795 0 obj
<<
/Title (Women and gender-diverse social media users describe reporting as confusing, opaque, and emotionally draining. Experts agree that while scale limits fully human moderation, platforms can improve trust and effectiveness by clearly prioritising urgent harms and communicating what happens after a report is made \(see Section 4.1\).)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 6789 0 R
>>
