/Title (Some suggestions focused on platform governance-level measures, such as stronger identity verification processes, limits on creating multiple accounts, or mechanisms that make it harder for people who have been blocked or banned to reappear under new identities. Participants felt that these measures could improve accountability and reduce repeat harassment.)
