7476 0 obj
<<
/Title (Experts also reflected on the potential burden placed on users. Frequent warnings, confirmations, or notifications may become normalised and ignored over time, reducing their usefulness or adding cognitive load. Overly complex controls could disproportionately affect people with lower digital literacy or those already managing stressful situations.)
/Dest [49 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7450 0 R
/First 7496 0 R
/Last 7496 0 R
/Count -1
>>
endobj
7477 0 obj
<<
/Title (Participants also expressed uncertainty about whether screenshots alone would be considered trustworthy or sufficient, particularly if they needed to escalate a case to the platform, the Australian eSafety Commissioner, or police. As a result, current approaches felt fragile, time-consuming, and dependent on users remembering to document incidents themselves.)
/Dest [50 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7427 0 R
/Prev 7451 0 R
/Next 7497 0 R
>>
endobj
7478 0 obj
<<
/Title <>
/Dest [50 0 R /Fit]
