/Parent 7452 0 R
/Prev 7500 0 R
/First 7501 0 R
/Last 7501 0 R
/Count -1
>>
endobj
7481 0 obj
<<
/Title (Participants asked for stronger forms of retraction that could support complete removal of content and reduce the likelihood of future misuse. Suggestions included deleting messages or images from both sides of a conversation, bulk or time-range deletion such as removing all content from a specific period of engagement with the abuser, and options to automatically remove sensitive media that had already been shared. These features were framed as ways to regain control, prevent continued threats or redistribution, and reduce the emotional impact of revisiting harmful material.)
/Dest [51 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7401 0 R
/Prev 7453 0 R
/Next 7502 0 R
>>
endobj
